n this research pass. Hosted web demos redeploy from master on every commit, so their URLs are not immutable baselines. Pin a compatible source commit for repeatable tests; the development branch and web renderer can differ from stable desktop behavior.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Choose a stable demo branch or release compatible with the installed Godot version; pin its commit.","Download one demo directory, import its project.godot and run its main scene.","Save the engine version, scene, input sequence and expected result alongside the baseline.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Change one movement or collision rule and verify the original scene still starts and completes its objective.","Import a known model or animation, then compare material loading, scale, skeleton mapping and exported behavior.","Replay the same input sequence and record screenshots, errors and task completion.","AI 使用与评估条件","A useful open-license baseline for code editing and automated playtests. Record licenses of any additional assets or plugins rather than treating the demo license as a grant for unrelated data.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98],"evidence",{"_58":103,"_25":104},{"_58":101,"_25":102},{"_58":99,"_25":100},"Repository license","https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/blob/master/LICENSE.md","Official browser builds","https://godotengine.github.io/godot-demo-projects/","Official source and branch guidance","https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects","查看许可条款",[108],"licenseUrl",{"_58":105,"_25":100},"许可类别","开放许可资源","terms","provenance","资产许可","Repository MIT license applies unless an individual demo or bundled resource states otherwise; keep local attribution notices.","assetLicense","代码许可","MIT; retain the repository license and notices.","codeLicense","开始使用",[122],"access",{"_58":123,"_25":102,"_124":125},"Play browser demos","note","Free browser builds and downloadable source projects. B